---
import type { Locale } from "../data/i18n";
interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}
const { locale = "fr" } = Astro.props;
const en = locale === "en";
const t = (fr: string, english: string) => (en ? english : fr);
const levels = {
  independent: t("Projet mené en autonomie", "Independent project delivery"),
  routine: t("Autonome sur les cas courants", "Independent on routine tasks"),
  supported: t(
    "Autonomie avec appui ponctuel",
    "Independent with occasional support",
  ),
  developing: t("Pratique à approfondir", "Practice to develop"),
};
const domains = [
  [
    "cadrage",
    t("Cadrage métier", "Business scoping"),
    "independent",
    t(
      "Clarifier le problème, évaluer la pertinence de l’IA et définir les critères de réussite.",
      "Clarify the problem, assess whether AI is appropriate and define success criteria.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "data",
    t("Préparation des données", "Data preparation"),
    "independent",
    t(
      "Choisir la méthode, contrôler la qualité et vérifier la séparation des données pour éviter les fuites.",
      "Choose the method, check data quality and verify data separation to prevent leakage.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "ml",
    t("ML supervisé", "Supervised ML"),
    "independent",
    t(
      "Choisir les métriques, comparer les modèles, examiner le surapprentissage et justifier le modèle retenu.",
      "Choose metrics, compare models, examine overfitting and justify the selected model.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "vision",
    t("Vision", "Computer vision"),
    "developing",
    t(
      "Une pratique encore limitée aux expériences de formation ; un domaine à approfondir.",
      "Practice still limited to training projects; an area for further development.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "rl",
    t("Apprentissage par renforcement", "Reinforcement learning"),
    "supported",
    t(
      "Analyser les résultats et tester des améliorations, avec parfois de l’aide pour le diagnostic et les ajustements.",
      "Analyse results and test improvements, sometimes seeking help with diagnosis and adjustments.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "genai",
    "RAG, agents & LLM",
    "independent",
    t(
      "Mener un projet, comprendre ses composants et superviser les résultats ; renforcer l’évaluation reste ma priorité.",
      "Deliver a project, understand its components and oversee results; stronger evaluation remains my priority.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "integration",
    t("API & applications", "APIs & applications"),
    "independent",
    t(
      "Concevoir et réaliser une application, relier les composants et vérifier le résultat.",
      "Design and build an application, connect its components and verify the result.",
    ),
  ],
  [
    "ops",
    "MLOps",
    "routine",
    t(
      "Mettre en œuvre les pratiques courantes de déploiement et de suivi ; approfondir les situations complexes.",
      "Apply routine deployment and monitoring practices; develop experience with complex situations.",
    ),
  ],
] as const;
const languages = [
  [t("Français", "French"), t("Natif", "Native")],
  [t("Anglais", "English"), "C1"],
  [t("Espagnol", "Spanish"), "A2"],
  [t("Russe", "Russian"), "A1"],
];
---

<section
  id="autoevaluation"
  class="self-assessment"
  aria-labelledby="assessment-title"
>
  <p class="assessment-date">
    {t("Autoévaluation · 14 octobre 2026", "Self-assessment · 14 October 2026")}
  </p>
  <h2 id="assessment-title">
    {t("Mon autonomie dans la pratique", "My independence in practice")}
  </h2>
  <p>
    {
      t(
        "Je m’appuie sur l’IA pour écrire du code et approfondir certains points techniques. Mon autonomie repose sur ma capacité à choisir la méthode, comprendre les composants et vérifier le résultat.",
        "I use AI to write code and explore technical details. My independence rests on choosing the method, understanding the components and verifying the result.",
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p class="assessment-note">
    {
      t(
        "Ces niveaux sont déclarés, pas des notes de jury ni des pourcentages calculés à partir des projets. Ils décrivent les tâches ci-dessous, sans attribuer le même niveau à chaque technologie du domaine.",
        "These levels are self-reported, not assessor grades or percentages calculated from projects. They describe the tasks below, without assigning the same level to every technology in a domain.",
      )
    }
  </p>
  <ul class="assessment-grid">
    {
      domains.map(([id, title, level, description]) => (
        <li class="assessment-card" data-level={level}>
          <span class="assessment-level">{levels[level]}</span>
          <h3>{title}</h3>
          <p>{description}</p>
          <a href={`#domain-${id}`} data-skill-domain={id}>
            {t(
              "Voir les compétences et les preuves",
              "Explore skills and evidence",
            )}{" "}
            ↗
          </a>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <h3>{t("Langues", "Languages")}</h3>
  <ul class="assessment-languages">
    {
      languages.map(([language, level]) => (
        <li>
          <>
            <strong>{language}</strong>
            <span>{level}</span>
          </>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>
  <p class="assessment-note">
    {
      t(
        "Niveaux de langue autoévalués ; aucune certification linguistique n’est revendiquée.",
        "Self-assessed language levels; no language certification is claimed.",
      )
    }
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href={`${en ? "/en" : ""}/formation/bilan/`}
      >{
        t(
          "Lire mon recul sur le parcours et mes priorités",
          "Read my reflections and priorities",
        )
      } ↗</a
    > · <a href={`${en ? "/en" : ""}/parcours/#approche`}
      >{t("Découvrir ma façon de travailler", "Explore how I work")} ↗</a
    >
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  .self-assessment {
    scroll-margin-top: 110px;
  }
  .assessment-date,
  .assessment-note {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .assessment-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  .assessment-card {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: var(--paper);
  }
  .assessment-card h3 {
    font-size: 23px;
    margin: 16px 0 10px;
  }
  .assessment-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .assessment-card a {
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .assessment-level {
    display: inline-block;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 5px 10px;
    background: var(--soft);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  [data-level="routine"] .assessment-level {
    border-left-style: double;
  }
  [data-level="supported"] .assessment-level {
    border-left-style: dashed;
  }
  [data-level="developing"] .assessment-level {
    border-left-style: dotted;
  }
  .assessment-languages {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .assessment-languages li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px 18px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .assessment-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .assessment-card {
      padding: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
